# Kaplay + TypeScript

- One Kaplay instance in `src/main.ts`. Scenes: title, wake, overworld, ending.
- Use TypeScript types for lords, dialog lines, and score state.
- Keep scene files thin: layout, input, calling systems.
- Dialog and score are modules, not copied into each scene.
- Pixel art: integer camera/scale; do not smooth/filter sprites.
- No `any`. Prefer explicit types for game data.
